+# Public API (`src/index.ts`)
+```ts
+resolvePointer(document: unknown, pointer: string): unknown
+class JsonPointerError extends Error { pointer: string }
+class JsonPointerSyntaxError extends JsonPointerError {}
+class JsonPointerResolveError extends JsonPointerError {}
+```
+Returns the referenced value; throws `JsonPointerSyntaxError` for invalid pointers (including non-string input), `JsonPointerResolveError` when nothing is referenced.
